stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> RUNNING: start (business key unique)
  RUNNING --> RUNNING: step transition, migration, incident retry
  RUNNING --> COMPLETED: last token reaches an end step
  RUNNING --> CANCELLED: cancel (processes:start)
  RUNNING --> COMPENSATING: onFailure compensate, or throwCompensation
  COMPENSATING --> FAILED: compensation stack empty
  COMPENSATING --> COMPENSATING: handler retry, manual incident
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  classDef engine fill:#E0F2F1,stroke:#00796B,stroke-width:2px,color:#16231F
  classDef external fill:#F3E5F5,stroke:#6A1B9A,color:#16231F
  classDef obs fill:#ECEFF1,stroke:#546E7A,color:#16231F
  class RUNNING engine
  class COMPENSATING external
  class COMPLETED,CANCELLED,FAILED obs
